      "html": "<div class=\"ds-strip\"><button class=\"ds-tab ds-on\" style=\"--hue:#5DA9E9\">Work</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Analyse</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Explain</button><button class=\"ds-tab\">Report</button></div>",
